              "guarantee": "The L7 count-delta check must FAIL BEFORE any write: a source that suddenly carries half as many streets is a publisher error, not a legal road-network change, and the operator override CENTRELINE_ACCEPT_FEATURE_COUNT_DRIFT=1 ENABLES execution but NEVER suppresses the FAIL row — so the abort must land at the pre_write gate, before the DELETE opens a transaction that would empty the network enrich-centreline reads."
