            "order_guarantee": {
              "anchor": "F-C1 dual-mode (L15 / H-v1.3.2): zero-temp on subsequent run",
              "guarantee": "The F-C1 guard runs in JS BEFORE pipeline.withTransaction begins (Spec 62 §3.7: 'Check happens in JS BEFORE this transaction begins'): on a FIRST run (no prior) with zero carried rows there is nothing to insert, and letting the DELETE open would empty the network for a publisher-side empty archive — so the abort must land before the transaction, with the target untouched."
            }
